      [Exposit
       "Er, nothing!"
       [PortraitDialogue [Characters PlayerHappy]]]
      [FacialExpression Aiko 4 0 0.2]
      [Exposit
       "What are you doing here anyway? Class is downstairs, this is the art room."
       [PortraitDialogue [Characters AikoNeutral]]]
      [Exposit
       "Oh I was just having a look around."
       [PortraitDialogue [Characters PlayerHappy]]]
      [FacialExpression Aiko 3 1 0.3]
      [Exposit
       "Well i'm Aiko, nice to meet you!"
       [PortraitDialogue [Characters AikoHappy]]]
      [Exposit
       "I like to come here between classes... art is my favorite class."
       [PortraitDialogue [Characters AikoHappy]]]
      [FacialExpression Aiko 3 0 0.3]
      [Exposit
       "Class will start soon, i'll meet you down there!"
       [PortraitDialogue [Characters AikoHappy]]]
      [Advent AikoFirstMeeting]
      [SwitchToZoneAndSwapPlayer Corridors ArtRoomExit]]
